# ── CoinMarketCap ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Shelfware needs NO secret to answer the ticker question:
#   python3 -m shelfware MS    -> roster from the committed snapshot (labelled with its date),
#                                 listing state LIVE and keyless from /public-api (0 credits)
#
# Optional. A free Basic key moves the roster leg to a live call (1 credit per ticker) and
# unlocks the full census (`python3 -m shelfware census`, ~5 credits, ~40 s).
# Get from: https://coinmarketcap.com/api  (Basic tier is enough — every keyed call here is Basic)
# The CLI reads it from the environment at call time, never from a file; never commit it.
# CMC_API_KEY=

# ── Optional overrides (no secret) ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Path of the roster snapshot the keyless ticker question falls back to. Default:
# data/roster_snapshot.json (cut from the committed census by `make seed`). Tests use it.
# SHELFWARE_SNAPSHOT=
